{"title":"Gold Kryss","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Thak Footman, Ogre Shaman, Werewolf, Thak Spearman, Gaunt Ogre +5 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · STR 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Dagger</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-the-mercy-knives\">The Mercy Knives</a></b> (Warden Maud Ferrow, level 11): free, and you keep the skill for good, or study a <b>Dagger tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton-knight\" title=\"Skeleton Knight - dropped it in 1 of 13 looted corpses (1/13)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/440f07a708d79a6d9303.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton Knight</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton-man-at-arms\" title=\"Skeleton Man At Arms - dropped it in 1 of 13 looted corpses (1/13)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/06e9ed76c917cacb3bdc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton Man At Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"wraith\" title=\"Wraith - dropped it in 1 of 14 looted corpses (1/14)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/aeaf0aa4188ec64745fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wraith</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 65 of 1,183 looted corpses (1/18)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/18<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 2 of 495 looted corpses (1/248)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/248<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 2 of 673 looted corpses (1/337)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/337<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 368 looted corpses (1/368)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/368<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 2 of 850 looted corpses (1/425)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/425<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 709 looted corpses (1/709)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/709<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 2 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/1,889)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,889<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gold-kryss\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip on q-all\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=inferior\">Inferior <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=crude\">Crude <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>46</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=good\">Good <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"gold-kryss\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" clas